# Per-deployment overrides. On the VPS:
#   cp stellaris-empire-planner.override.env.template stellaris-empire-planner.override.env
# then fill in the values below. The .override.env file is NOT committed.

# Public origin the planner is served from (your reverse proxy's URL).
